OL,3,AFlight delays and cancellations across
OL,4,AUS as services resume after ground stop
OL,5,
OL,6,FFlights across the US are delayed or
OL,7,Fcancelled on Saturday morning, as
OL,8,Fknock-on disruption continues after a
OL,9,Fnationwide ground stop
OL,11,FThe grounding began at around 16:00 EST
OL,12,F(21:00 GMT) on Friday and lasted more
OL,13,Fthan four hours - here's a timeline of
OL,14,Fhow it unfolded
OL,16,FTransportation Secretary Sean Duffy
OL,17,Fsays the ripple effects could last for
OL,18,Fdays - it was the longest ground stop
OL,19,Fin the US since the one after the 9/11
OL,20,Fattacks in 2001
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
