OL,3,AFlight delays and cancellations across
OL,4,AUS as services resume after ground stop
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Saturday morning, some transatlantic
OL,7,Fflights from the UK have also been
OL,8,Fdisrupted, with passengers warned of
OL,9,F"follow-on disruption"
OL,11,FOfficials say the incident was caused
OL,12,Fby a "telecommunications outage" and
OL,13,Fplace the blame on old systems
